# =============================================================================
# The Cadenza repository. The tracked source of truth is the specification tree, the neutral
# build-loop commands (commands/), the entry point (start.sh), the seed toolchain under
# implementation/seed/, the design docs under implementation/design/, and the issue archive
# under issues/. Locally, `trunk` is the integration branch (mapped onto origin/main via PR);
# the hub is a bare repo, so all work happens in worktrees under the gitignored .claude/.
# Ignored below: the built `implementation/stable` binary, the target/ dirs, and the gitignored
# .claude/ (the local install target for commands/ + skills/, plus the fleet state in
# .claude/fleet/ — registry, inboxes, per-agent worktrees, and the live work queue that the
# pr-sync agent mirrors into the tracked issues/ archive).
# =============================================================================

# Editor / OS / agent-local
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
*.swo
.DS_Store
.direnv/
result
.claude/

# stray editor/rust-analyzer flycheck output at repo root
target/

# Compiled seed compiler binary (regenerable via cargo build)
implementation/stable
Cargo.lock
